 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看充值这一头。",
   "spoken": "先看充值这一头。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.44,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.829
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "假充值，是交易所把一笔不该算数的转账，记成了用户的充值。",
   "spoken": "假充值，是交易所把一笔不该算数的转账，记成了用户的充值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 3.26,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 3.26,
   "speechEnd": 9.12
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "失败的、伪造的、到账金额不对的，都算。",
   "spoken": "失败的、伪造的、到账金额不对的，都算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 9.56,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 9.56,
   "speechEnd": 13.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "第一种，交易失败了，却已经上链。",
   "spoken": "第一种，交易失败了，却已经上链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 13.46,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 13.559,
   "speechEnd": 16.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "扫描服务只看交易存不存在，不看执行状态。",
   "spoken": "扫描服务只看交易存不存在，不看执行状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 16.8,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 16.8,
   "speechEnd": 20.566
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "2019 年 3 月，SlowMist 披露了 EOS 上的这类手法，TRON 和以太坊也要防。",
   "spoken": "2019 年 3 月，SlowMist 批路了 EOS 上的这类手法，TRON 和以太坊也要防。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 21.02,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 21.111,
   "speechEnd": 27.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "第二种，无效交易被入账。",
   "spoken": "第二种，无效交易被入账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 28.2,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 28.293,
   "speechEnd": 30.575
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "2018 年 6 月，SlowMist 预警，部分交易所没有校验 Omni-USDT 交易的 valid 字段。",
   "spoken": "2018 年 6 月，SlowMist 预警，部分交易所没有较验 Omni-USDT 交易的 valid 字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 30.98,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 31.088,
   "speechEnd": 38.009
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "第三种，部分支付，这是 XRP 的一个特性。",
   "spoken": "第三种，部分支付，这是 XRP 的一个特性。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 38.4,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 38.4,
   "speechEnd": 42.271
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "一笔支付写的请求金额，可以远大于实际到账的金额。",
   "spoken": "一笔支付写的请求金额，可以远大于实际到账的金额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 42.7,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 42.797,
   "speechEnd": 47.128
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "2024 年 1 月，有人向 Bitfinex 发起了一笔部分支付。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 1 月，有人向 Bitfinex 发起了一笔部分支付。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 47.56,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 47.56,
   "speechEnd": 51.829
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "名义金额约 150 亿美元，实际到账约 0.001 美元。",
   "spoken": "名义金额约 150 亿美元，实际到账约 0.001 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 52.26,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 52.352,
   "speechEnd": 58.897
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "Bitfinex 按实际到账金额入账，攻击没有成功。",
   "spoken": "Bitfinex 按实际到账金额入账，攻击没有成功。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 59.28,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 59.382,
   "speechEnd": 63.306
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "第四种，假代币，名字和符号都能照抄。",
   "spoken": "第四种，假代币，名字和符号都能照抄。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 63.74,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 63.74,
   "speechEnd": 67.509
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "第五种，伪造的转账事件，系统只看 Transfer 事件，不看它来自哪个合约。",
   "spoken": "第五种，伪造的转账事件，系统只看 Transfer 事件，不看它来自哪个合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 67.96,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 67.96,
   "speechEnd": 73.819
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "第六种，确认数不够就入账，之后区块回滚，这笔充值也跟着消失。",
   "spoken": "第六种，确认数不够就入账，之后区块回滚，这笔充值也跟着消失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 74.26,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 74.354,
   "speechEnd": 80.105
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "这些形态，可以归成一条原则。",
   "spoken": "这些形态，可以归成一条原则。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 80.56,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 80.656,
   "speechEnd": 83.163
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "以链上执行结果和实际到账金额为准。",
   "spoken": "以链上执行结果和实际到账金额维准。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 83.58,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 83.58,
   "speechEnd": 86.613
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "入账之前，过四道检查。",
   "spoken": "入账之前，过四道检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 87.0,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 87.097,
   "speechEnd": 89.132
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "执行成功了吗。",
   "spoken": "执行成功了吗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 89.54,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 89.634,
   "speechEnd": 90.385
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "代币合约地址，在白名单里吗。",
   "spoken": "代币合约地址，在白名单里吗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 90.8,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 90.898,
   "speechEnd": 92.763
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "实际到账多少。",
   "spoken": "实际到账多少。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-21.wav",
   "start": 93.18,
   "dur": 1.44,
   "speechStart": 93.18,
   "speechEnd": 94.392
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "确认数够了吗。",
   "spoken": "确认数够了吗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-22.wav",
   "start": 94.84,
   "dur": 0.96,
   "speechStart": 94.84,
   "speechEnd": 95.643
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "最后，用第二个独立节点再复核一遍。",
   "spoken": "最后，用第二个独立节点再复核一遍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-23.wav",
   "start": 96.02,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 96.02,
   "speechEnd": 99.159
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
   "text": "只靠一个节点，节点被篡改或者不同步，也会记错账。",
   "spoken": "只靠一个节点，节点被篡改或者不同步，也会记错账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg3-24.wav",
   "start": 99.6,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 99.6,
   "speechEnd": 104.209
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-25",
